## Design Decisions

| Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|
| **Branded IDs** | Prevents passing an `AuthorId` where a `PostId` is expected. Zero runtime cost. |
| **Tags as objects, not `string[]`** | Separates display name from URL slug and allows renaming without breaking links. Use `string[]` if your needs are simpler. |
| **`AuthorSummary` embedded** | Posts usually only need display info, not the full author record. |
