| **Tagged `PostBody`** | Renderers know exactly how to handle the content. It also supports migrating from markdown to a block editor later. |
| **Separate input types** | Clients can't set `id`, `createdAt`, or `status` directly. Relationships are passed by ID. |
| **ISO strings over `Date`** | Survives JSON serialization unchanged. Convert to `Date` at the edges when needed. |

