  type Published = BasePost & { status: "published"; publishedAt: ISODateString };
  ```
- **Slug**: Separate from the title so URLs stay stable when titles are edited.
- **Input types derived from the main type** with `Pick`/`Omit`/`Partial`, so they stay in sync automatically.

