  slug: string;
  name: string;
  /** Short tagline shown under the name. */
  tagline?: string;
  price: Money;
  compareAtPrice?: Money;
  images: ProductImage[];
  /** Long-form description with formatting. */
  description: RichText;
  variants?: ProductVariant[];
  /** Optional metadata for SEO / sharing. */
  seo?: {
    title?: string;
    description?: string;
  };
  createdAt: ISODateString;
  updatedAt: ISODateString;
}
```

## Design notes

- **`Money` uses minor units** (`amount: 1999` = `$19.99`) to avoid floating-point rounding bugs. Format with `Intl.NumberFormat` at render time.
- **`RichText` is a discriminated union of blocks.** Each block has a `type` field, so a renderer can `switch (block.type)` and get exhaustiveness checking for free.
- **`InlineNode`** separates plain text from links, so you can't accidentally nest a link inside a link.
- **`ProductImage` requires `alt` and dimensions** — the former for a11y, the latter to prevent layout shift (CLS).
- **`HeadingBlock.level` is `2 | 3 | 4`** so the product name can own the `<h1>`.

