## 7. Things you may want to add later

- **Versioning / revisions** — `PostRevision[]` keyed by `postId` for drafts history.
- **Comments** — a separate `Comment` entity referencing `postId`; don't nest them in the post.
- **Series / collections** — `series?: { id: ID; order: number }` for multi-part posts.
- **Localization** — `translations?: Record<Locale, { title: string; body: PostBody }>`.
- **Reading time** — compute from `body` at write time and cache it; don't recompute per request.
- **Soft deletes** — add `deletedAt?: ISODateString` rather than removing rows, so links don't 404 silently.

```ts
// A tag attached to a post
