  id: string;
  title: string;
  author: Author;          // embedded author object
  tags: Tag[];             // embedded tag objects
  body: string;            // Markdown or HTML
  status: PostStatus;
  excerpt?: string;        // short summary for listings / SEO
  publishedAt?: string;    // ISO 8601 date string; absent while draft
  createdAt: string;       // ISO 8601 date string
  updatedAt: string;       // ISO 8601 date string
}
```

## Variants depending on your needs

**1. Normalized (references instead of embedded objects)** — best when authors/tags are shared across many posts and stored in their own tables:

```ts
