## Design notes

| Field | Decision | Rationale |
|---|---|---|
| `title` | `string` | Keep plain; enforce length/content rules at the validation boundary. |
| `author` | Object or `authorId` | Embed for read-heavy APIs; reference it in the database. |
| `tags` | `readonly Tag[]` | `readonly` prevents accidental mutation of shared state; use `Set` only if you need membership checks. |
| `body` | `string` or `readonly BodyBlock[]` | String for Markdown; blocks for structured rendering/editor integration. |
| Dates | ISO strings | Serializable over JSON; swap to `Date` if you stay in-process. |

For runtime safety, pair these types with a schema validator (e.g. Zod) so untrusted API input conforms before it enters the system.

